graph TB
    subgraph Image["odh-trustyai-nemo-guardrails-server-rhel9 (Dockerfile.konflux)"]
        Entrypoint["scripts/entrypoint.sh<br/>validates CONFIG_ID / PORT<br/>--disable-chat-ui, optional OTel wrapper"]
        Server["nemoguardrails server<br/>FastAPI on uvicorn<br/>0.0.0.0:8000 plain HTTP"]
        Checks["Fork checks router<br/>/v1/guardrail/checks<br/>deprecated, sunset 2027-02-01"]
        Engine["LLMRails engine<br/>Colang 1.0 / 2.x flows"]
        Library["Guardrails library<br/>content_safety, Presidio, YARA injection,<br/>hf_classifier, topic_safety, regex, gliner,<br/>llama_guard, f5, polygraf, guardrails_ai"]
        HeaderFwd["header_forwarding.py<br/>X-* headers, X-Authorization to Authorization"]
        Models["Baked-in modelcar models<br/>MiniLM, Arctic embed, spaCy en_core_web_lg,<br/>NLTK punkt, Wolf Defender, Granite Guardian HAP<br/>HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1"]
        Cache["In-process caches<br/>rails instances per config_ids+model"]

        Entrypoint -->|launches| Server
        Server -->|mounts router| Checks
        Server -->|_get_rails| Engine
        Checks -->|runs rails| Engine
        Engine -->|invokes rails| Library
        Library -->|loads| Models
        Server -->|caches| Cache
        Engine -->|outbound headers| HeaderFwd
    end

    subgraph Build["Build-time only"]
        Filter["filter_guardrails.py + provider-list.yaml<br/>GUARDRAILS_PROFILE=opensource<br/>removes 15 closed-source modules"]
        Setup["setup_modelcar_models.py<br/>stages models into HF/NLTK caches"]
    end

    subgraph NotShipped["Present in source, not launched in RHOAI"]
        ChatUI["Chainlit chat UI /chat"]
        ActionsSrv["Actions server 8001/TCP"]
        Sidecars["jailbreak_detection 1337/TCP<br/>align_score 5000/TCP"]
        MockLLM["benchmark/mock_llm_server"]
    end

    Filter -.->|strips modules| Library
    Setup -.->|populates| Models

    Operator["TrustyAI service operator<br/>NemoGuardrails CR, not in this repo"] -->|creates Deployment, Service, Route| Server
    ConfigVol["Rails config volume<br/>/app/config/CONFIG_ID<br/>YAML, Colang, config.py, actions.py"] -->|loaded per request / exec at startup| Server
    Operator -->|mounts ConfigMap| ConfigVol

    Client["Client apps / Llama Stack"] -->|POST /v1/chat/completions| Server
    HeaderFwd -->|OpenAI-compatible REST| LLM["Main LLM<br/>KServe / vLLM<br/>MAIN_MODEL_BASE_URL"]
    Server -.->|OTLP, optional| OTel["OTLP collector"]

